<title>LESOTHO: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>LESOTHO GOVERNMENT LIST (961218)</p>
<p> Head of State (Sworn in 7 Feb 1996)...............King LETSIE</p>
<p>				   - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET(Formed 8 Apr 1993, Reshuffle effective May 6 1996):</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Sworn in 2 April 93)............Ntsu MOKHEHLE</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Defence &amp; Public Service)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister......................Pakalitha MOSISILI</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Home Affairs &amp; Local Government)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>Agriculture, Cooperatives, Youth</p>
<p>    Affairs..................................Mopshatla MABITLE</p>
<p> Defence &amp; Public Service...................See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Education, Manpower Development.................Lesao LEHOHLA</p>
<p> Finance, Economic Planning.......................Victor KETSO</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs................................Kelebone MAOPE</p>
<p> Health &amp; Social Welfare...........................Tefo MABOTE</p>
<p> Home Affairs &amp; Local Government.................See Deputy PM</p>
<p> Information &amp; Broadcasting...................Monyane MOLELEKI</p>
<p>Justice, Human Rights, Law &amp;</p>
<p>    Constitutional Affairs...................Sephiri MOTANYANE</p>
<p> Labour &amp; Employment..............................Notsi MOLOPO</p>
<p> Natural Resources....................Shakhane Robong MOKHEHLE</p>
<p> Tourism, Sports &amp; Culture.....................Pasho MOCHESANE</p>
<p> Trade, Industry...................................Lira MOTETE</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Communications.....................Mamoshebe KABI</p>
<p> Without Portfolio............................Phabiso QHOJENGE</p>
<p> Works..........................................Mohaila MOHALE</p>
<p>				- - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Parliamentary Speaker...........................Teboho KOLANE</p>
<p>				- - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor........................Anthony MARUPING</p>
<p>				- - - - - - - -</p>
